    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an intelligent AI Lead Qualification and Sales Support Agent.\n\nAnalyze this lead:\nName: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.lead_name }}\nJob title: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.job_title }}\nCompany: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.company }}\nIndustry: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.industry }}\nCompany size: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.company_size }}\nLocation: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.location }}\nWebsite: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.website }}\nEmail: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.email }}\nPhone: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.phone }}\nSource: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.source }}\nPain point: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.pain_point }}\nBuying signal: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.buying_signal }}\n\nRules:\n1. Determine whether the lead is Qualified or Not Qualified.\n2. Score the lead from 0 to 100.\n3. Consider: job/title relevance, company fit, industry fit, potential business need, buying intent/signals, data completeness.\n4. Give a short, clear reason for the qualification decision.\n5. Never invent missing company, personal, contact, buying-signal, or business information. Use \"Unknown\" for anything not provided.\n6. For qualified leads only, write a concise personalization summary usable for outreach.\n7. Generate a professional outreach email subject and body using only available information. No unsupported claims.\n8. Do not send anything yourself — only draft it.\n9. If not qualified, recommended_action must be \"nurture\" or \"archive\". If qualified, recommended_action must be \"outreach\".\n\nReturn ONLY the structured JSON object requested.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a precise, factual B2B lead qualification analyst. Never fabricate data."
        }
      },
